<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<div style="font-weight:600;font-size:12px">Flux through a closed surface</div>
<div style="color:#555;line-height:1.35">Uniform field <b>E</b> = E ŷ (E = 1), cube face area A = 4.</div>
